        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: పుట్టినరోజు",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "పుట్టినరోజు (puṭṭinarōju) — \"a birthday\", literally \"the day one was born\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "రోజు is the day you know. On the day, say పుట్టినరోజు (puṭṭinarōju) శుభాకాంక్షలు — \"happy birthday\", with the good wishes you already have."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "పుట్టినరోజు (puṭṭinarōju) is native puṭṭina, \"on which one was born\", from puṭṭu, \"to be born\" (DEDR 4264), and rōju, \"day\", from Persian rōz."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A day to name, and a wish to make on it."
            }
          ]
        },
